WEBVTT

01:24.880 --> 01:28.200
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:36.160 --> 01:39.440
Inspector Zhang.

01:53.920 --> 01:55.560
I'm in this look again.

01:58.520 --> 01:59.720
Apologies for the trouble,
Inspector Zhang.

02:07.440 --> 02:09.400
You used yourself as bait
to lure out Zheng Zhixing.

02:09.479 --> 02:10.600
It was too risky.

02:12.360 --> 02:14.040
I know it was risky,

02:15.880 --> 02:18.000
but Zheng Zhixing left no evidence.

02:19.280 --> 02:20.880
To clear Lady Huan's name,

02:21.480 --> 02:23.320
this is the only way to break the case.

02:23.960 --> 02:24.800
There's no other way.

02:25.760 --> 02:29.280
But your current evidence
is just Zheng Zhixing's own confession.

02:30.280 --> 02:32.040
He could still say you forced him.

02:34.800 --> 02:36.800
At least this will bring him to justice.

02:37.320 --> 02:38.840
I trust you, Inspector Zhang.

02:39.920 --> 02:44.760
Rest assured,
I will do everything I can to protect you

02:45.480 --> 02:46.960
and bring you justice.

02:51.840 --> 02:53.040
Inspector Zhang,

02:55.000 --> 02:56.960
this isn't about my justice.

02:58.240 --> 03:00.640
It's about justice for Lady Huan.

03:02.320 --> 03:05.840
She's suffered too much in life,
betrayed by her lover.

03:05.920 --> 03:07.200
Even after her death,

03:07.280 --> 03:09.040
she's still accused
of trafficking stolen goods.

03:09.560 --> 03:10.720
This is not justice.

03:20.720 --> 03:22.640
I'll gather evidence soon

03:25.200 --> 03:26.200
and start the trial.

03:27.920 --> 03:29.400
Take care of yourself.

03:34.160 --> 03:35.120
Inspector Zhang,

03:40.800 --> 03:41.920
could you hold a public trial?

03:56.880 --> 04:00.080
Mr. Xu, please help me! I was deceived…

04:09.000 --> 04:13.520
I never imagined
that you'd be locked in such a tiny cell.

04:18.320 --> 04:19.560
No one's troubling you, right?

04:25.080 --> 04:26.760
It's all your fault.

04:26.840 --> 04:28.600
You betrayed the family,

04:28.680 --> 04:31.440
conspiring with that wretch Su Muzhe
to harm me!

04:31.520 --> 04:34.960
Si, watch what you say.

04:35.480 --> 04:37.960
These days,
if I'm not at the Governor's office,

04:38.040 --> 04:40.400
I'm wandering
between the old house and the villa,

04:40.480 --> 04:41.680
nowhere else.

04:45.880 --> 04:49.040
Oh, you're saying
the news I passed to you?

04:50.440 --> 04:52.800
It's all nonsense from Garuda,

04:52.880 --> 04:54.240
completely mistaken.

04:54.320 --> 04:56.120
Si, don't worry.

04:56.200 --> 04:59.840
-I'll give him a proper scolding!
-You…

05:08.760 --> 05:10.960
Seeing you in good spirits,

05:11.600 --> 05:13.200
I can leave with peace of mind.

05:15.320 --> 05:17.520
Si, don't worry.

05:17.600 --> 05:20.560
The family is doing everything
to get you out.

05:26.160 --> 05:29.520
Is there anything
you'd like me to tell Father?

05:35.480 --> 05:37.200
I've given everything I have,

05:38.480 --> 05:40.000
risking severe punishment.

05:41.000 --> 05:42.640
Father won't abandon me.

05:44.200 --> 05:47.960
Zheng Wu, you're overthinking this.

05:54.160 --> 05:55.680
Si, don't worry.

05:56.240 --> 06:00.960
I'll pass on
exactly what you said to Father.

06:04.480 --> 06:06.240
Here's all your favorite dishes,

06:07.440 --> 06:08.360
still hot.

06:16.720 --> 06:20.720
I am the legitimate son,
the true heir of the Zheng family!

06:38.080 --> 06:41.800
Mr. Xu, is there really no other way?

06:41.880 --> 06:44.600
He's nothing but a worthless fool,

06:45.240 --> 06:48.760
easily provoked by Su Muzhe
and spilling the truth right away.

06:50.640 --> 06:52.240
That disgrace…

06:53.080 --> 06:55.000
Master, Lady Shijiu of the Cui family
seeks an audience.

06:55.080 --> 06:56.320
I won't see her!

07:01.880 --> 07:03.560
-Let her in.
-Understood.

07:12.560 --> 07:13.520
Greetings to you both.

07:13.600 --> 07:16.520
Master Shijiu,
you always favored men's attire,

07:16.600 --> 07:20.400
but you have a unique charm
in women's clothing.

07:20.480 --> 07:23.720
Are you thinking
of becoming Lady Shijiu again?

07:23.800 --> 07:25.400
Mr. Xu, you jest.

07:25.920 --> 07:29.560
Whether I'm dressed as a man or a woman,
it's all for others to see.

07:29.640 --> 07:34.040
I have only one true identity, Cui Shijiu.

07:34.840 --> 07:37.360
Cui Shijiu, why have you come to see me?

07:37.440 --> 07:38.840
I've come here today,

07:38.920 --> 07:41.720
first, to issue a warning,
and second, to offer advice.

07:43.400 --> 07:44.600
Speak.

07:44.680 --> 07:46.360
In Lady Huan's case,

07:46.440 --> 07:49.680
the mastermind
behind it all is Yan Zijing.

07:49.760 --> 07:51.720
I'm sure I don't need
to remind you both of this.

07:51.800 --> 07:53.440
However, Mr. Xu,

07:53.520 --> 07:56.560
you only know how Yan Zijing
stirred up chaos in Guangzhou.

07:56.640 --> 07:58.560
What you don't know is, back in Wuling,

07:58.640 --> 08:00.960
he played the weak
in front of Master Eight,

08:01.040 --> 08:03.520
but uprooted everyone behind the scenes,

08:03.600 --> 08:06.160
all to expose
Master Eight's secret dealings

08:06.240 --> 08:08.800
with the Black Dragon Bandits.

08:09.440 --> 08:10.720
So what?

08:11.240 --> 08:13.480
What befell the Cui family long ago

08:14.320 --> 08:16.120
is now about to happen
to the Zheng family.

08:16.200 --> 08:17.080
Nonsense!

08:17.160 --> 08:20.160
Whether it's nonsense,
you both know in your hearts.

08:20.240 --> 08:21.520
I'll say no more.

08:22.560 --> 08:24.000
But given the current situation,

08:24.080 --> 08:26.640
with both Lady Huan's case
and the smuggling scandal,

08:26.720 --> 08:28.880
someone will have to take all the blame

08:29.480 --> 08:31.520
and sever every link.

08:31.600 --> 08:32.799
Only then will they let go.

08:35.720 --> 08:36.840
Cui Shijiu,

08:38.080 --> 08:39.840
did Zheng Wu instruct you to say this?

08:39.919 --> 08:41.960
Zheng Wu doesn't know I'm here.

08:42.480 --> 08:45.440
I'm offering this advice
solely based on the situation.

08:48.560 --> 08:51.200
Mr. Xu, Mr. Zheng,

08:51.280 --> 08:54.360
that's all I have to say. Farewell.

08:58.480 --> 09:02.400
This Cui Shijiu, since leaving Guangzhou,

09:03.360 --> 09:05.720
has toned down much of her fierceness.

09:05.800 --> 09:09.360
She's steadier but more ruthless now.

09:09.960 --> 09:14.040
Do you know why Prince Ying
sent me to Yangzhou?

09:14.680 --> 09:19.560
He feared seeing you like this,
hesitant to make the tough decisions.

09:31.040 --> 09:32.120
Master Yan,

09:32.800 --> 09:37.800
if Mr. Qin or the Baicaojing House
has offended you in any way,

09:37.880 --> 09:39.200
I apologize on their behalf.

09:39.280 --> 09:40.800
He didn't offend me.

09:43.560 --> 09:44.880
You did.

09:45.480 --> 09:47.440
Why did you set up Su Muzhe?

09:49.360 --> 09:52.480
Master Yan, I truly don't understand.

09:54.520 --> 09:55.560
You don't understand?

10:09.360 --> 10:10.440
It was Zheng Si!

10:10.520 --> 10:13.280
He gave me the witness
and blood-stained letter.

10:14.120 --> 10:15.080
And?

10:15.600 --> 10:18.360
He instructed that the moment
I hear of Lady Huan's death,

10:18.440 --> 10:21.000
I should take the witness
and evidence to the Governor's Office.

10:21.960 --> 10:23.480
Master Yan!

10:23.560 --> 10:26.240
Qin Mu can't endure
this kind of punishment!

10:26.320 --> 10:29.240
Please, release him! Master Yan…

10:29.320 --> 10:32.840
if you want to save your brother,
you should know what to do.

10:32.920 --> 10:34.400
I'm willing to testify against Zheng Si.

10:34.480 --> 10:35.920
I'll go and testify against him!

10:37.760 --> 10:38.920
Kang Ju.

10:41.480 --> 10:43.160
-Mu…
-Tomorrow,

10:43.680 --> 10:45.720
if you dare say a single wrong word,

10:46.240 --> 10:49.280
the whole of Yangzhou will know
Qin Mu is your brother.

10:49.360 --> 10:51.480
By then, the former top beauty

10:51.560 --> 10:54.600
and the Baicaojing House
will both be a laughingstock.

10:54.680 --> 10:57.560
But by that time,
it won't matter for your brother,

10:57.640 --> 10:59.560
as he'll already be dead.

10:59.640 --> 11:00.760
Don't worry, Master Yan,

11:01.440 --> 11:02.920
I won't say a single wrong word,

11:03.000 --> 11:04.800
as long as…

11:04.880 --> 11:06.680
you release my brother.

11:06.760 --> 11:08.840
After the task is done tomorrow,

11:09.400 --> 11:11.560
come back and take your dear brother.

11:15.960 --> 11:17.440
When Lady Huan died,

11:18.360 --> 11:19.800
she was holding a torn sleeve.

11:20.960 --> 11:25.760
Zheng Zhiheng, someone accused you
of owning that sleeve.

11:26.520 --> 11:27.840
Do you have anything to say?

11:28.360 --> 11:31.600
In response to Inspector Zhang,
I own many clothes.

11:32.200 --> 11:33.640
I genuinely don't remember.

11:34.160 --> 11:36.240
Someone must have framed me.

11:36.960 --> 11:38.920
I trust Inspector Zhang
will see the truth.

11:39.000 --> 11:40.840
Is there anyone who can prove

11:41.360 --> 11:42.840
you weren't at the scene
when the incident occurred?

11:45.840 --> 11:47.000
I can prove it.

11:53.280 --> 11:55.200
Cui Shijiu?

11:55.280 --> 11:57.640
-This isn't Cui Shijiu.
-At the time of the incident,

11:57.720 --> 11:59.000
Zheng Wu was with me.

12:00.480 --> 12:04.120
A man and a woman alone,
meeting in secret.

12:04.200 --> 12:05.520
It's not exactly respectable,

12:05.600 --> 12:09.480
but it's not a crime either.

12:10.720 --> 12:11.880
Su Muzhe,

12:12.640 --> 12:15.000
someone reported
that at the time of the incident,

12:15.080 --> 12:16.800
you were seen in Riverside Alley.

12:17.800 --> 12:18.920
Do you have anything to say?

12:19.000 --> 12:20.600
In response to Inspector Zhang,

12:21.920 --> 12:25.000
I went to Riverside Alley
to look for Lady Shiqi.

12:26.160 --> 12:28.440
She had gone to sell jewelry
and hadn't returned for a long time,

12:28.520 --> 12:31.320
so I brought Gaoshou with me to find her.

12:32.480 --> 12:34.480
By the time we arrived
at the small courtyard,

12:35.800 --> 12:37.480
Lady Shiqi had fainted,

12:40.320 --> 12:42.240
and Lady Huan was already gone.

12:42.320 --> 12:45.920
So, you two were the man
and woman who fled?

12:46.600 --> 12:48.960
That man was carrying something heavy,

12:49.480 --> 12:51.960
which must have been Miss Yue beside you.

12:52.560 --> 12:56.080
Inspector Zhang, the situation is clear.

12:56.160 --> 13:00.440
First, Bai Niao accused Su Muzhe
of killing for profit,

13:00.520 --> 13:04.400
and just now, she admitted they were all
at the scene during the incident.

13:04.480 --> 13:05.360
In my opinion,

13:05.440 --> 13:09.120
these three are undoubtedly the culprits
behind Lady Huan's murder.

13:09.200 --> 13:10.520
-Mr. Xu…
-Mr. Xu.

13:10.600 --> 13:12.480
I have a report to make!

13:17.760 --> 13:20.520
Mr. Xu, Inspector Zhang.

13:20.600 --> 13:22.840
Before this,

13:22.920 --> 13:25.760
the blood-stained letter
and the witness accusing Ms. Su

13:28.000 --> 13:29.600
were both brought to me by Zheng Si!

13:31.320 --> 13:34.160
But I never expected
that after Zheng Si was imprisoned,

13:34.240 --> 13:35.880
the witness disappeared.

13:35.960 --> 13:36.920
Only then did I think

13:37.000 --> 13:38.960
to examine
the blood-stained letter carefully,

13:39.720 --> 13:42.960
realizing it wasn't written
by Lady Huan at all.

13:43.560 --> 13:46.120
Zheng Si is from a noble family,

13:46.640 --> 13:49.640
and I always knew
he was close with Lady Huan,

13:50.600 --> 13:53.040
so I assumed
he was seeking revenge for her.

13:53.120 --> 13:56.240
Foolishly, I believed him,
and this led to my grave mistake.

13:57.200 --> 14:00.560
I ask for your mercy, Mr. Xu,
Inspector Zhang.

14:01.120 --> 14:05.520
Bai Niao, making false accusations
is a serious crime.

14:06.720 --> 14:09.200
I was misled by others

14:10.040 --> 14:11.560
and misunderstood Ms. Su.

14:14.280 --> 14:18.600
Zheng Zhixing,
do you have any further confessions?

14:27.680 --> 14:28.880
Zheng Zhixing,

14:29.560 --> 14:31.560
you can remain silent,

14:32.600 --> 14:33.920
but remember,

14:34.920 --> 14:36.760
in Lady Huan's embroidery chamber,

14:37.280 --> 14:40.000
you personally admitted to tricking
her into trafficking stolen goods

14:40.640 --> 14:42.360
and then mercilessly killed her.

14:42.440 --> 14:43.760
I heard it,

14:44.600 --> 14:46.240
Mr. Xu heard it,

14:46.960 --> 14:48.720
and even more soldiers heard it too.

14:49.560 --> 14:50.720
Zheng Si,

14:51.400 --> 14:52.840
I'll ask you again.

14:53.360 --> 14:56.240
Did you instruct Bai Niao

14:57.280 --> 15:00.800
to frame Su Muzhe
with the forged blood-stained letter?

15:15.840 --> 15:19.360
The Zheng family
will do everything to protect you.

15:19.880 --> 15:23.200
After all, your mother
is still the lady of the Cui family.

15:23.280 --> 15:26.640
But if something happens
to the Cui family,

15:27.200 --> 15:28.240
then…

15:32.120 --> 15:33.800
In the Zheng family,

15:35.520 --> 15:37.360
anyone could be sacrificed

15:41.240 --> 15:42.760
for the sake of the Zheng family.

15:46.480 --> 15:48.480
For the Zheng family!

15:54.480 --> 15:55.320
Yes.

15:56.920 --> 15:58.040
I admit it.

15:59.840 --> 16:01.200
I killed her,

16:01.960 --> 16:05.360
and I bribed Bai Niao

16:06.400 --> 16:08.320
to frame Su Muzhe.

16:09.800 --> 16:10.960
He confessed!

16:11.040 --> 16:13.720
-He killed Lady Huan!
-What a heartless creature!

16:13.800 --> 16:15.280
Lady Huan died for nothing.

16:15.360 --> 16:16.480
So, he was the killer.

16:21.280 --> 16:22.320
All these treasures,

16:22.840 --> 16:24.360
upon investigation,

16:24.880 --> 16:26.920
are loot
from the Black Dragon Bandits of Hexi.

16:28.240 --> 16:31.840
Lady Huan secretly hid them as clues
before she died,

16:31.920 --> 16:34.480
proving that this stolen loot
came from the Zheng family.

16:36.160 --> 16:38.760
You Zhengs colluded
with the bandits from Hexi,

16:38.840 --> 16:40.440
fencing stolen goods to build wealth.

16:41.040 --> 16:42.200
Zheng Zhixing,

16:43.640 --> 16:44.840
do you acknowledge your crime?

16:44.920 --> 16:46.240
The Black Dragon Bandits!

16:46.320 --> 16:48.360
-Zheng family's trafficking…
-Inspector Zhang,

16:48.920 --> 16:51.960
the matter of the Black Dragon Bandits
hasn't been fully investigated.

16:52.040 --> 16:54.400
Don't jump to conclusions.

16:59.760 --> 17:01.200
It's not the Zheng family.

17:05.319 --> 17:06.319
It's the Cui family.

17:09.720 --> 17:10.839
The Cui family is responsible!

17:10.920 --> 17:11.880
You're lying…

17:14.839 --> 17:17.200
The Cui family gave me those jewels.

17:19.240 --> 17:20.839
The Zheng family knew nothing of it.

17:22.440 --> 17:25.400
I had no idea where those jewels came from

17:25.480 --> 17:27.680
or anything
about the Black Dragon Bandits.

17:28.640 --> 17:30.400
The Cui family is my mother's side,

17:31.080 --> 17:34.400
and my uncle, Cui Jingchu,
gave them to me before he died.

17:35.400 --> 17:37.200
This has nothing to do
with the Zheng family.

17:41.640 --> 17:42.760
I confess.

17:46.040 --> 17:47.200
I am willing to face death.

17:47.280 --> 17:50.520
Zheng Zhixing has confessed

17:52.040 --> 17:54.520
to murder and trafficking.

17:55.120 --> 17:56.000
Guards,

17:56.520 --> 17:59.600
take him away
to the death row to await sentencing!

17:59.680 --> 18:03.000
Mr. Xu, Inspector Zhang,

18:05.560 --> 18:07.200
Lady Huan was innocent in this.

18:08.640 --> 18:10.600
She was deceived by Zheng Zhixing

18:11.560 --> 18:14.280
and shouldn't be linked
to the crime of trafficking.

18:15.400 --> 18:20.840
I ask you to clear her name today
and remove her unjust charges.

18:20.920 --> 18:22.120
Of course.

18:22.720 --> 18:24.360
Take Zheng Zhixing away!

18:24.440 --> 18:25.400
Yes, sir.

18:33.640 --> 18:35.000
Thank you, Inspector Zhang.

18:36.760 --> 18:38.000
Thank you, Mr. Xu.

18:42.520 --> 18:43.440
Bai Niao,

18:44.560 --> 18:46.200
you made a false accusation,

18:46.800 --> 18:48.480
but you were misled and deceived

18:49.000 --> 18:50.240
by others.

18:51.560 --> 18:54.080
This time, your only punishment
is a fine of ten million mace

18:54.720 --> 18:57.240
to cover Lady Huan's funeral expenses.

18:58.040 --> 19:00.080
Thank you, Inspector Zhang.

19:00.720 --> 19:04.160
Su Muzhe and Zheng Zhiheng are innocent.

19:04.240 --> 19:07.760
Besides, Su Muzhe risked his own life,

19:08.360 --> 19:10.520
baiting Zheng Zhixing
into confessing publicly.

19:10.600 --> 19:13.800
Such noble action deserves commendation.

19:15.080 --> 19:16.160
She is to be released immediately!

19:27.680 --> 19:29.920
Mr. Xu, what do you think?

19:34.840 --> 19:36.720
Agreed. Court is adjourned!

19:43.840 --> 19:45.320
Rise quickly.

19:46.560 --> 19:48.360
Inspector Zhang
and Mr. Xu are wise indeed,

19:48.440 --> 19:49.720
-Inspector Zhang is wise.
-fair and just.

19:49.800 --> 19:51.880
The legitimate son of the Zheng family
actually did such deeds!

19:52.960 --> 19:55.240
And the Cui family is involved in fencing!

19:58.320 --> 20:00.320
This time, we failed
to convict the Zhengs.

20:01.600 --> 20:03.720
You don't seem too pleased.

20:03.800 --> 20:05.680
I'm just an observer.

20:06.280 --> 20:07.800
What's there to be pleased about?

20:07.880 --> 20:08.720
Yan Zijing,

20:08.800 --> 20:11.640
your Yan family's old case
still has a chance to be cleared.

20:12.160 --> 20:13.760
Don't let this opportunity slip by.

20:14.360 --> 20:16.000
Everything should be resolved
within the law.

20:17.760 --> 20:20.680
You believe in the law, but I do not.

20:20.760 --> 20:23.040
Many people, driven by selfish gain,

20:23.560 --> 20:26.080
are undermining
the very foundation of the law.

20:26.160 --> 20:28.520
You may have captured
these lawless criminals,

20:29.040 --> 20:31.040
but can you truly expose
those working behind the scenes?

20:31.760 --> 20:33.000
How do you know I wouldn't dare?

20:36.040 --> 20:38.080
Xu Nanying, sitting there in the hall,

20:38.880 --> 20:40.320
was once Prince Tan's man,

20:40.840 --> 20:45.040
but then he switched sides to Prince Ying
and quickly gained favor.

20:45.120 --> 20:46.080
Do you know why?

20:46.680 --> 20:49.520
Black is black, and white is white.

20:50.480 --> 20:52.360
I will always uphold justice.

20:53.000 --> 20:56.160
If one day you break the law,

20:56.240 --> 20:57.760
I will treat you the same.

21:06.920 --> 21:09.040
How can you stay seated?

21:09.120 --> 21:10.400
That's ten million…

21:10.920 --> 21:12.680
Ten million mace!

21:13.240 --> 21:15.680
You said following Xu Nanying
would bring us wealth and fame?

21:15.760 --> 21:20.320
But without Mr. Xu's support,
we wouldn't have opened such a large shop.

21:21.120 --> 21:22.760
He had no choice but to rule that way.

21:22.840 --> 21:24.280
I don't have the money anyway.

21:24.360 --> 21:27.920
Don't worry,
I can still afford the ten million mace.

21:30.120 --> 21:31.520
I've got some jewelry here.

21:31.600 --> 21:33.240
Take it and melt it down.

21:34.080 --> 21:37.920
After paying the fine,
use the rest to find a good craftsman

21:38.440 --> 21:40.640
and buy some fine white jade and gems.

21:40.720 --> 21:42.120
Will that be enough?

21:42.200 --> 21:45.320
Mu, you need to think long-term.

21:45.840 --> 21:47.440
Take that Clear Mind for example.

21:47.960 --> 21:50.520
They don't sell
particularly valuable jewels,

21:50.600 --> 21:52.040
but their designs are fresh and unique.

21:52.640 --> 21:53.920
You should learn from Su Muzhe.

21:54.000 --> 21:56.880
Don't mention Su Muzhe to me.
Just hearing her name gets me mad.

21:56.960 --> 21:59.120
We worked so hard
to make a name for ourselves.

21:59.200 --> 22:00.840
You have to manage it well.

22:01.640 --> 22:03.600
With Mr. Xu's support,

22:03.680 --> 22:07.280
I believe Baicaojing House
will be renowned across the land one day.

22:08.440 --> 22:09.720
Alright, I get it.

22:09.800 --> 22:10.920
Don't worry.

22:11.440 --> 22:12.440
I'm heading out now.

22:28.080 --> 22:29.240
Father.

22:29.920 --> 22:32.800
-Wu, you're back.
-Yes.

22:32.880 --> 22:36.360
From now on, the Zheng family's
responsibilities will rest on you.

22:37.760 --> 22:40.480
The Red Leaf Crown commissioned
by Prince Ying for the Empress Dowager,

22:40.560 --> 22:42.400
we must not delay it.

22:43.480 --> 22:45.040
This task is yours to handle.

22:45.560 --> 22:48.000
Go to Zhenlang Pavilion
and find Yan Zijing

22:48.080 --> 22:50.560
and secure ruby first.

22:50.640 --> 22:54.120
Father, what if he demands a high price?

22:54.200 --> 22:55.880
Agree to it for now.

22:56.640 --> 23:00.280
But remember,
he is the Zheng family's great enemy.

23:00.920 --> 23:02.280
I'll remember, Father.

23:11.080 --> 23:12.080
Wu,

23:13.720 --> 23:15.440
you are my son,

23:15.520 --> 23:17.800
just as Si is.

23:18.760 --> 23:23.480
For the sake of the Zheng family,
he took everything upon himself.

23:25.360 --> 23:28.640
Don't hold onto past grudges.

23:31.240 --> 23:32.440
Understood, Father.

23:36.400 --> 23:37.400
Father,

23:38.160 --> 23:40.640
I also visited brother in prison.

23:40.720 --> 23:43.720
Do you think we should
find a way to get him out?

23:44.320 --> 23:45.600
Remember.

23:46.400 --> 23:48.400
Pieces on a chessboard
are neither black nor white.

23:49.120 --> 23:51.600
It's the player who decides.

23:51.680 --> 23:55.640
The Zheng family's century-old legacy
has never done anything wrong.

23:55.720 --> 23:59.600
Those who fight us
are challenging the hand that plays.

23:59.680 --> 24:01.520
They will be crushed sooner or later!

24:05.640 --> 24:07.040
Forgive me, Father.

24:07.720 --> 24:09.040
I understand.

24:14.560 --> 24:16.440
The Cui family has fallen completely,

24:17.960 --> 24:20.040
and Cui Shijiu
is unworthy to be your wife.

24:20.120 --> 24:22.120
Don't get entangled with her anymore.

24:22.640 --> 24:23.960
Don't worry, Father.

24:25.200 --> 24:26.920
I know what to do.

24:32.000 --> 24:33.040
Miss.

24:35.720 --> 24:38.040
VIRTUE SURPASSES MATERIAL TREASURE

24:40.200 --> 24:42.040
-Duanwu!
-You're finally out!

24:45.360 --> 24:48.480
Alright, why are you crying?

24:48.560 --> 24:51.400
You don't know. Every night
while you were away, we prayed for you,

24:51.480 --> 24:53.800
especially Yunxiu.
I was worried she'd fall ill.

24:53.880 --> 24:56.280
I'm fine.

24:56.360 --> 24:57.920
Let's go home.

24:59.160 --> 25:00.960
-Oh, right!
-What's this?

25:02.840 --> 25:04.680
-Come on, Miss.
-Wait. What's this about?

25:04.760 --> 25:06.000
-Come on…
-Step over it.

25:06.080 --> 25:07.400
-Step over it.
-Quickly!

25:07.480 --> 25:08.560
Take it slow.

25:09.080 --> 25:10.320
-Great!
-Great!

25:10.400 --> 25:11.920
After a great disaster,
blessings are sure to come!

25:12.000 --> 25:14.320
Exactly!
Ms. Su, fate protects the blessed!

25:18.480 --> 25:19.400
Come on.

25:28.880 --> 25:33.960
CLEAR MIND

25:42.640 --> 25:44.480
-Greetings, Inspector Zhang.
-Greetings, Inspector Zhang.

25:44.560 --> 25:45.840
You're back.

25:48.040 --> 25:52.560
Duanwu, you chat with Inspector Zhang,
and we'll go inside and tidy up.

25:55.080 --> 25:56.280
Let's go.

26:08.960 --> 26:10.720
Thank you, Inspector Zhang.

26:12.880 --> 26:15.880
Since when do we need to say
"thank you" between us?

26:16.480 --> 26:20.360
And you called me "Inspector Zhang".
This is just part of my duty.

26:20.440 --> 26:24.880
Once Clear Mind reopens,
I'll definitely invite you for a drink.

26:24.960 --> 26:28.000
If you want to invite me for a drink,
do you have to wait until it reopens?

26:34.600 --> 26:36.120
I haven't been back in so long.

26:37.640 --> 26:38.920
Everything's changed.

26:42.120 --> 26:45.440
If it's messy or dirty,
we can wipe it clean.

26:46.160 --> 26:47.480
Just like…

26:48.320 --> 26:50.360
what's past has scattered with the wind,

26:50.440 --> 26:52.040
leaving no trace in the heart.

26:52.120 --> 26:53.920
That's true freedom in this world.

26:55.880 --> 26:57.640
Come on. Let me help you.

26:59.760 --> 27:00.760
You'll help me?

27:06.360 --> 27:07.200
Let's go.

27:17.720 --> 27:18.720
Ms. Yingtao.

27:20.880 --> 27:21.880
Mr. Gaoshou.

27:24.000 --> 27:25.440
Today,

27:26.440 --> 27:27.800
you must be exhausted from helping us.

27:27.880 --> 27:30.280
Not at all!

27:31.640 --> 27:32.480
Then…

27:33.240 --> 27:34.120
please, sit.

27:54.120 --> 27:56.720
Ms. Yingtao, this isn't proper…

28:00.640 --> 28:02.320
Your mustache is fake!

28:05.440 --> 28:07.480
Let me see what you look like without it.

28:12.120 --> 28:13.400
Now, you look even more handsome!

28:16.240 --> 28:18.920
Well, my buddies did say

28:19.600 --> 28:20.520
I look decent.

28:21.360 --> 28:22.840
Then, why do you wear a fake mustache?

28:30.040 --> 28:33.720
Don't you think it makes me look tougher?

28:36.000 --> 28:37.680
I don't think you look tough at all.

28:41.200 --> 28:42.360
You mean

28:43.480 --> 28:46.600
my efforts were all in vain?

28:46.680 --> 28:50.080
Outsiders might think that,
but I never thought you were tough.

28:56.120 --> 28:59.280
If my Ms. Yingtao thinks it's fine,
then it's fine.

29:00.000 --> 29:01.720
So, you're called Gaoshou.

29:02.240 --> 29:03.240
Does that mean…?

29:04.040 --> 29:07.480
Gaoshou is indeed just a nickname.

29:07.560 --> 29:09.080
What's your real name?

29:09.160 --> 29:10.680
My real name

29:11.600 --> 29:12.440
is Gao Daliang.

29:13.520 --> 29:14.400
Gao Daniang?

29:14.480 --> 29:17.120
It's "liang," not "niang"!

29:17.760 --> 29:19.440
Gao Daniang?

29:20.960 --> 29:25.880
Ms. Yingtao, you can call me
however you like.

29:25.960 --> 29:28.240
Just don't let others know.

29:31.080 --> 29:32.920
Is this also fake?

29:36.960 --> 29:39.080
LOUD'S MEMORIAL TABLET

29:39.160 --> 29:41.840
WEI YAN'S MEMORIAL TABLET

30:38.920 --> 30:40.040
Huan,

30:41.400 --> 30:43.480
you've never been to my Clear Mind.

30:44.760 --> 30:46.440
These are my dearest ones.

30:47.720 --> 30:49.200
From now on,

30:50.920 --> 30:52.760
Clear Mind is your home.

30:54.240 --> 30:55.520
This whole life,

30:56.120 --> 30:58.800
you were bound
by the obligations of the Huan family,

30:58.880 --> 31:00.600
unable to follow your own heart.

31:02.720 --> 31:07.680
Yet you were so genuine and passionate

31:10.400 --> 31:12.120
and trusting the wrong person.

31:13.200 --> 31:14.720
Your radiant youth

31:19.840 --> 31:21.160
ended in tragedy.

31:24.720 --> 31:26.480
I feel your life was unjust.

31:28.880 --> 31:30.720
Though our time together was short,

31:32.400 --> 31:34.240
I felt such a deep bond.

31:35.080 --> 31:36.720
In my life,

31:39.640 --> 31:41.280
meeting you

31:43.600 --> 31:45.120
was truly worthwhile.

31:53.520 --> 31:54.520
Huan,

31:57.680 --> 31:59.040
in your next life,

32:03.280 --> 32:04.320
may you find peace,

32:05.880 --> 32:07.040
comfort,

32:11.080 --> 32:12.720
and be your true self.

33:17.640 --> 33:18.640
Where's Yan Zijing?

33:18.720 --> 33:21.160
He's not here.

33:39.600 --> 33:40.560
What's your business with me?

33:41.560 --> 33:43.280
How did you get Bai Niao
to change her testimony?

33:45.600 --> 33:46.720
I held her brother hostage.

33:50.080 --> 33:51.240
Are you trying to say

33:51.320 --> 33:53.920
that I've always preferred
using such despicable tactics?

33:54.000 --> 33:55.600
So, it was your doing.

34:01.440 --> 34:04.280
Now Zheng Zhixing has taken
the fall for the Zheng family,

34:05.720 --> 34:07.560
something you didn't anticipate, did you?

34:07.640 --> 34:10.639
This time I failed,
but there will be a next time.

34:11.159 --> 34:14.760
I have only one goal in this life,
and I will achieve it.

34:16.239 --> 34:18.920
But from now on, the Zheng family
will be led by Zheng Zhiheng.

34:19.560 --> 34:20.760
Good luck to you.

34:20.840 --> 34:23.320
The Zhengs wish to dominate
Yangzhou alone,

34:23.840 --> 34:26.560
uncaring if the Cui family
was ruined over the tribute pearls.

34:27.159 --> 34:28.719
Little did they know

34:28.800 --> 34:30.639
that it was actually done
by the Yan family of Yangzhou.

34:30.719 --> 34:32.639
What are you trying to say?

34:33.520 --> 34:35.080
Stay out of this matter.

34:35.159 --> 34:37.360
Years ago,
the tribute convoy was ambushed,

34:37.440 --> 34:39.280
and my father died because of it.

34:40.080 --> 34:41.400
I want to know the truth.

34:45.040 --> 34:48.480
Back then, it was a conspiracy
between the Cui and Zheng families.

34:54.199 --> 34:55.719
So, how could I not be involved?

34:56.480 --> 34:58.600
Aren't you supposed to be a merchant now?

34:59.440 --> 35:02.680
Look at the state of your Clear Mind.
Take care of yourself first.

35:11.080 --> 35:12.280
No need to worry about me.

35:23.000 --> 35:24.080
Shijiu,

35:25.640 --> 35:28.120
you risked your reputation
to testify for me,

35:29.640 --> 35:31.160
and I, Zheng Wu, swear

35:33.120 --> 35:34.520
never to let you down in this life.

35:35.160 --> 35:37.560
I'm the proud legitimate daughter
of the Cui family.

35:38.480 --> 35:40.280
Now, I become your concubine.

35:41.720 --> 35:43.280
You must feel triumphant.

35:44.640 --> 35:45.760
Except the title,

35:47.280 --> 35:49.000
I can give you everything.

35:50.280 --> 35:52.800
Then yesterday, when Zheng Si
slandered the Cui family,

35:52.880 --> 35:54.000
why did you stay silent?

35:56.160 --> 35:57.880
Because there's no one left
in the Cui family,

35:57.960 --> 36:00.360
so we can bear all the blame?

36:01.760 --> 36:05.200
It all happened so suddenly.
I didn't expect it to turn out this way.

36:05.280 --> 36:07.240
But it was the only way
to save the Zheng family.

36:07.320 --> 36:09.200
Only by saving the Zheng family

36:09.720 --> 36:13.480
can I and we have a future.

36:17.160 --> 36:19.160
Although Father favors me,

36:20.160 --> 36:22.400
Zheng Si is still the legitimate son.

36:22.960 --> 36:25.160
Even he was so easily abandoned.

36:26.160 --> 36:28.240
What if it were me instead this time?

36:31.160 --> 36:32.640
How is our situation any different?

36:34.920 --> 36:37.080
I am also my father's legitimate daughter.

36:37.160 --> 36:40.760
I would still be beaten
and abandoned just the same.

36:56.200 --> 36:57.440
You're right.

36:58.960 --> 37:00.200
We're the same.

37:03.560 --> 37:04.680
Shijiu,

37:05.760 --> 37:07.360
we only have each other.

37:14.160 --> 37:16.240
But you will have your legitimate wife,

37:18.080 --> 37:18.960
and where will that leave me?

37:24.760 --> 37:27.360
Wu, I want

37:28.400 --> 37:29.680
a shop of our own,

37:30.600 --> 37:35.840
so I can have a fallback in the future,
no longer living at the mercy of others.

37:35.920 --> 37:37.000
What do you think?

37:42.480 --> 37:43.480
We'll have it.

37:54.280 --> 37:55.360
Mother!

37:56.240 --> 37:58.920
Where are you going so late?

38:03.680 --> 38:05.960
I'm going to see off Lady Cui.

38:12.240 --> 38:15.160
Actually, you're good enough.

38:15.240 --> 38:16.720
But alas, in this life,

38:16.800 --> 38:19.600
you're destined
not to be Zheng Wu's legitimate wife.

38:21.400 --> 38:23.400
A wise woman

38:23.920 --> 38:26.200
knows her place.

38:38.760 --> 38:40.760
Zheng Shiyuan has lost a son,

38:41.360 --> 38:43.400
and all the loot was confiscated.

38:44.040 --> 38:46.440
Now he has no choice
but to buy ruby from you at a high price.

38:46.520 --> 38:48.600
These setbacks have cost him dearly.

38:49.200 --> 38:50.440
On top of that,

38:50.520 --> 38:53.400
Zheng Shiyuan gave up
on Zheng Si so easily,

38:53.480 --> 38:57.040
which will surely disappoint
Zheng Zhiheng in his father.

38:57.560 --> 39:01.920
The fall of the Zheng family
is only a matter of time.

39:04.720 --> 39:06.680
Will I live to see that day?

39:06.760 --> 39:08.080
Whether you do or not,

39:08.160 --> 39:10.080
you'll just have to wait.

39:11.320 --> 39:12.360
You must live well.

39:22.200 --> 39:24.960
What did she say to you today?

39:25.040 --> 39:28.240
With ears as sharp as yours,
didn't you hear it all?

39:30.240 --> 39:31.400
I didn't hear it.

39:31.480 --> 39:32.960
She was so calm.

39:34.880 --> 39:36.640
That doesn't seem like her usual self.

39:37.960 --> 39:39.360
And to her,

39:41.440 --> 39:43.040
I'm just an enemy.

39:43.120 --> 39:46.520
She already knows the Zhengs
are linked to the Black Dragon Bandits.

39:46.600 --> 39:48.720
Why are you still hiding it from her?

39:50.280 --> 39:52.320
Do you really want her
to hate you for life?

39:52.400 --> 39:54.120
Even if I told her,
what would that change?

39:54.840 --> 39:57.160
Right now,
all she cares about is Clear Mind.

39:57.920 --> 39:59.200
I think that's for the best.

40:01.120 --> 40:04.840
Besides, if I told her
it was the Black Dragon Bandits

40:04.920 --> 40:07.600
and that Li Kui killed Cao Da and Shrimp,

40:08.120 --> 40:09.440
how do you think she would react?

40:10.480 --> 40:13.200
Are you really
not thinking about yourself at all?

40:13.800 --> 40:16.480
The Black Dragon Bandits
have been rampant for so many years,

40:17.320 --> 40:19.160
and even the authorities
couldn't do anything about it.

40:19.680 --> 40:20.800
So,

40:20.880 --> 40:23.360
even we don't know
if we can defeat Li Kui.

40:23.440 --> 40:27.320
Why involve her and let her risk her life?

40:41.040 --> 40:44.600
Lady, what will we do from now on?

40:46.240 --> 40:47.240
Even the Master…

40:47.320 --> 40:50.160
Decades of loyalty, yet he still…

40:56.520 --> 40:59.400
I'm paying my respects to you
one last time, Lady.

41:01.640 --> 41:04.280
You should feel fortunate.

41:04.360 --> 41:06.280
Master is a man of sentiment.

41:06.360 --> 41:09.040
Otherwise,
instead of sending you to the convent,

41:09.120 --> 41:10.280
he would have sent you away entirely.

41:12.480 --> 41:15.680
Zheng Shiyuan is hypocritical
and heartless.

41:16.240 --> 41:18.840
My son sacrificed himself
for the Zheng family,

41:19.360 --> 41:20.880
and so did I.

41:20.960 --> 41:25.520
But now, it's your turn

41:26.160 --> 41:27.640
and your Zheng Wu's.

41:27.720 --> 41:29.680
What goes around comes around.

41:30.200 --> 41:31.920
That day will come.

41:35.440 --> 41:37.160
Is everyone dead?
What are you standing there for?

41:39.720 --> 41:40.560
Let's go back, Lady.

41:40.640 --> 41:42.640
That day will come!

41:45.920 --> 41:47.560
-Don't push! We can walk ourselves.
-Lady,

41:47.640 --> 41:49.120
don't listen to her nonsense.

41:49.200 --> 41:52.040
From now on, you're the lady
of the Zheng family.

41:56.840 --> 42:00.640
My Zheng Wu
finally doesn't have to suffer anymore.

42:01.160 --> 42:02.120
Yes.

42:30.360 --> 42:32.520
Why did Zheng Zhixing
and Zheng Yuqing die in prison?

42:32.600 --> 42:34.160
They broke their bowls

42:34.240 --> 42:35.800
and used the shards
to take their own lives.

42:35.880 --> 42:38.920
Not even immortals could've saved them.

42:39.440 --> 42:41.560
I've already punished
the jailers severely,

42:41.640 --> 42:44.600
but this is as far as it goes.

42:44.680 --> 42:48.440
Their deaths are not that simple.

42:48.520 --> 42:50.360
Prince Ying has decreed

42:51.280 --> 42:53.400
that the Black Dragon Bandits
have been wiped out.

42:53.480 --> 42:57.720
The era of bandits ravaging Hexi is over.

42:58.920 --> 43:01.240
Don't stir up any more trouble.

43:07.680 --> 43:10.880
Jinran, listen to my advice.

43:11.480 --> 43:14.440
Let the past stay in the past.

43:40.280 --> 43:41.840
There…

43:41.920 --> 43:44.080
There's a white figure up ahead.

43:45.120 --> 43:47.960
Could it be Lady Huan's spirit returned?

43:49.120 --> 43:50.040
Lady Huan just passed away.

43:51.280 --> 43:53.280
Let's see who's pretending
to be a ghost here.
